{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/cfd8aa21d42068499ae7fcf02ccb83bb.avif?t=1774120959\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the golden ages of video rentals by opening your very own video store. Rent, sell, organize and build your business from the ground up.\u00a0Hire staff, manage your team and become the best rental destination in town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/2be0b2580c17420a50f7d7f985113eb2.poster.avif?t=1774120959\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/2be0b2580c17420a50f7d7f985113eb2.webm?t=1774120959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/2be0b2580c17420a50f7d7f985113eb2.mp4?t=1774120959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/045426b9c7210f07ab10fb161ae874ee.avif?t=1774120959\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From taking reservations and charging late fees to recommending movies and preparing delicious snacks, there\u2019s never a dull moment when running your store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/a8fda65381deaca776cb10ef46b9df42.poster.avif?t=1774120959\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/a8fda65381deaca776cb10ef46b9df42.webm?t=1774120959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/a8fda65381deaca776cb10ef46b9df42.mp4?t=1774120959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/b568d1e21abf50b208ea10fddb9a3c49.avif?t=1774120959\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your walls and floors, decorate with posters and memorabilia and expand your layout to build the video store of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/2e2191b5d76b276468eea6b4395e0451.poster.avif?t=1774120959\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/2e2191b5d76b276468eea6b4395e0451.webm?t=1774120959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/2e2191b5d76b276468eea6b4395e0451.mp4?t=1774120959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/18bd76688f321dc51590416363fec76f.avif?t=1774120959\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your shelves with thousands of unique VHS tapes, each with their own title, genre and hand-drawn cover art!\u00a0Order movies on your old PC or buy exclusive bootleg films from the shady Tape Dealer.  Each week will have new releases inspired by real iconic movies of the 80s and early 90s.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/cf1b2944219b1522c2bfe4dc157ab2e0.poster.avif?t=1774120959\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/cf1b2944219b1522c2bfe4dc157ab2e0.webm?t=1774120959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/cf1b2944219b1522c2bfe4dc157ab2e0.mp4?t=1774120959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional</strong>\u00a0<strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Your Dream Team: Hire staff to give you a hand on daily tasks to run your store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Your Returns:\u00a0 Add returned movies in the system, rewind tapes and set aside reserved movies for your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge Late &amp; Broken Fees: Track late and damaged returns and deal with different customer reactions and complaints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving Customer Interactions: Seasons, weather and holidays affect gameplay and what your customers rent! Be ready, rainy Friday nights are crazy busy in the store!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasons &amp; Festivals: Play through all four seasons as the environment transforms around you. Each season features special holidays and festivals, all brought to life with unique artwork!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share Movies With Your Friends: Every movie can be ordered on your PC with a unique code that you can share with your friends!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Business Is Booming!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552140/0fbd73a776266bec816ff06e804a26b09f6f7c58.jpg"},{"name":"The Movie Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552140/2c20ee0d78942bfafe997a3690318d4597647b08.jpg"},{"name":"Popping Off!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552140/11b807666caea6288d6d6ee6922617f056e7798b.jpg"},{"name":"Sugar Rush!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552140/690b825025226a8ad1ffce90a8fcc7315cd346dd.jpg"},{"name":"Brain Freeze!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552140/0734b9be16660561959c580dd4565a87b22ad6af.jpg"},{"name":"Good Customer Service","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552140/c60da2c95d31bd8815e0a110c93eb1c9972d4b22.jpg"},{"name":"Return Routine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552140/015ccb67f568fe183f4b057d337b567f526c276a.jpg"},{"name":"First Hire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552140/6245a10686c46147c3712113b5c71c1c9ebe344a.jpg"},{"name":"Big Store Energy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552140/3bf98067b0c150f873bf58074df1ae88da785f32.jpg"},{"name":"RIP","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3552140/9de63edfd69b89fcde96e11631f450e668be0313.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552140?t=1774120959","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/13d4f7dd32c2f20b17b9bffc0bc388e1ec1a3c38/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774120959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/942cdcf14d5185e5f2f8e3999e79ab062b4aad22/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774120959","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/942cdcf14d5185e5f2f8e3999e79ab062b4aad22/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774120959","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3858710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/cfd8aa21d42068499ae7fcf02ccb83bb.avif?t=1774120959\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the golden ages of video rentals by opening your very own video store. Rent, sell, organize and build your business from the ground up.\u00a0Hire staff, manage your team and become the best rental destination in town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/2be0b2580c17420a50f7d7f985113eb2.poster.avif?t=1774120959\" width=1170 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552140/extras/2be0b2580c17420a50f7d7f985113eb2.webm?t=1774120959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https